Z||000003||Wade87GT||11-26-2001||11:47 AM||||I just installed my Power Pulley this past weekend. The Seat-O-Pants meter showed noticeable improvements in the low end torque range. I bought mine from the Fiero Store about a year ago (it came with the proper sized belt) but this was the first chance I had to install it. FYI, find replacement bolts with smaller sized heads. There isn't enough clearence to tighten the stock 4 outer bolts.||||reg||14
